<title>UK: Svenska prices $350 mln perpetual FRN.</title>
<headline>Svenska prices $350 mln perpetual FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue announced on Monday by lead manager Merrill Lynch, has now been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SVENSKA HANDELSBANKEN</p>
<p> AMT    $350 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY  **PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     *50 BP    PAY DATE    03.MAR.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  A1/A-     ISS PRICE  99.696    FULL FEES   0.625</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  REOFFER    99.696    LISTING     LUX</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO MARCH 2002, THEN STEPS UP TO 200 BP</p>
<p>	    **CALLABLE FROM MARCH 2002</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
